From 08ebddbccab50289de6d449c8041a405561d75e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tom Garton <tomgarton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 06:50:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Potty and nappy together for a child learning the potty

The potty box shows the time since the last nappy under it, and its sheet offers a nappy row
above the potty row: pick from either or both, then save.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 app/Puggle/Features/Log/LogSheet.swift    | 61 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 app/Puggle/Features/Today/ChildCard.swift | 30 +++++++++--
 docs/baby-tracker-spec.md                 | 14 ++++++
 3 files changed, 99 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/Puggle/Features/Log/LogSheet.swift b/app/Puggle/Features/Log/LogSheet.swift
index bde2dc4..14a9370 100644
--- a/app/Puggle/Features/Log/LogSheet.swift
